                                "example_id": "dfafbe64-c4c0-4ec9-8c7a-585ad9290ede",
                                "sense_id": "0675a8cd-86f3-3f27-9ea6-8b20c0699970",
                                "text": "In accounting, nonrecurring items are exceptional transactions that are not related to normal business operations. The most common nonrecurring items are capital gains, additional write-downs or reversals of write-downs, and provisions for planned restructuring and penalties."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
